    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban all development on green belt land",
        "additional_details": "We feel the development of new builds is harming our planet and local residents. Wildlife and plant life are dwindling and our breathable air is getting worse.\r\nIn addition, we already have old derelict buildings that can be rebuilt and it\u2019s not taking away from the green spaces as they have already been used.",
        "background": "Ban all developments on green belt land. We believe green belt land should exist to protect our existing wildlife spaces for our future.",
